(2) The core insight, "short lines run often, so split," recurs in nearly every city and becomes the default answer. Cities 6-10 mostly re-skin it with a new capacity source (carriage, snow, loop, wave). Few levels ask a different question, such as pure routing, nearest-glyph or what NOT to build. The best levels are exactly those: L32, L46, L76, L89, L17.
(3) Cards (calm, interchange) are used from L11 and L16 before 'calm' is ever taught, and the later cards are often decorative because the wrong pick still wins and only costs a star (L83, L84).
